<rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Event</rdfs:label>
<rdfs:subClassOf>https://cidoc-crm.org/Entity/e7-activity/version-6.2</rdfs:subClassOf>
<rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">LACRIMALit Event is an Activity (subClass of CIDOC-CRM E 7 Activity) carried out by an instance of LACRIMALit Agent (subClass of CIDOC-CRM E 39 Actor) that occurs at an instance of LACRIMALit Location and has a beginning date and an end date.</rdfs:comment>
